GasSettlementReceiver
└── when the receiver hot paths run on fresh state
    ├── given a settled delivery to a merchant without code
    │   └── it settles and the gas lands in the snapshot
    ├── given a settled delivery to a merchant with a succeeding callback
    │   ├── it settles and the gas lands in the snapshot
    │   └── it fits the documented recipient gas limit
    ├── given a rejected delivery
    │   └── it rejects and the gas lands in the snapshot
    └── given a credited merchant
        └── it withdraws and the gas lands in the snapshot
